WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:07.256
MOT test stations, welcome to The Motoring Central. This is how it works, and what's in it for you.

00:00:08.056 --> 00:00:17.631
Drivers book their MOT with us online, at any time of the day or night. They enter their postcode, and they see the test stations near them, with the times that are free.

00:00:18.431 --> 00:00:30.166
Every station charges the same price, the official maximum fee for the class. So there's no price war and no undercutting, and customers choose you for your location, your reviews, and your free times.

00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:40.598
They pick a time straight from your live diary, and they pay in full when they book. The booking drops into your MOT bay, with the customer, the vehicle and the registration.

00:00:41.398 --> 00:00:51.859
You set the days and the times you test, and the classes you test. Add your walk-ins and phone bookings to the same diary, and those times close online, so you're never double booked.

00:00:52.659 --> 00:00:58.540
If a customer needs a different time, you just move the booking in your diary, and we let them know straight away.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:11.104
So, what do you earn? We pay you the official fee, less a flat £5 for each test. That's £49.85 for every car MOT. There's no monthly fee, no commission, and no contract.

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:21.551
Every MOT is paid for up front, so there are fewer no-shows, and no payments to chase. You're paid every week, straight to your bank, and your statement shows every test.

00:01:22.351 --> 00:01:34.557
Joining takes about five minutes. Tick the MOT classes you test, add your DVSA test station number, and upload your insurance and photo ID. We check your documents, and your diary goes live.

00:01:35.357 --> 00:01:41.593
Your bays, your times, and paid every week. Join the network today, at motoringcentral.co.uk.
